# Ctrl+W s on the Overdue view opens it again in a new pane on the same entry, and completing the entry there takes it out of both panes.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2})
END
keys gO j <C-w> s
see │▌ - Write report
keys x
hide Write report
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write report @due({today-2}) @done({today})
END
